</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I belong to Jesus;</l><l>He is Lord and King,</l><l>Reigning in my inmost heart</l><l>Over everything.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I belong to Jesus;</l><l>What can hurt or harm,</l><l>When He folds around my soul</l><l>His almighty Arm?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I belong to Jesus;</l><l>Blessed, blessed thought!</l><l>With His own most precious blood</l><l>Has my soul been bought.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>I belong to Jesus;</l><l>He has died for me;</l><l>I am His and He is mine</l><l>Through eternity.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>I belong to Jesus;</l><l>He will keep my soul,</l><l>If the deathly waters dark</l><l>Round about me roll.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>I belong to Jesus;</l><l>And ere long I’ll be</l><l>With my precious Savior there</l><l>In His royalty.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
